"Data jadi benda: angka menjadi tumpukan yang bisa dihitung. Satu karung = satu juta ton.": "Data becomes objects: numbers become a pile you can count. One sack = one million tons.",
"Nilai menentukan mood berkunci. Mood berganti lewat satu take: antisipasi, wajah baru di squash terdalam, lalu settle.": "The value sets a locked mood. The mood changes in one take: anticipation, a new face at the deepest squash, then settle.",
"Suhu menjadi tokoh: menggigil saat dingin, berkeringat saat panas. Gerak murah tanpa jalan kaki.": "Temperature becomes a character: shivering when cold, sweating when hot. Cheap motion with no walking.",
"Wajah hanya diberikan pada benda, bukan orang. Gerak benda diatur lewat posisi, kempis-mengembang, sudut, mata, dan mulut. Wajah tidak pernah berganti mendadak: benda selalu ancang-ancang dulu, wajah baru muncul di titik terdalam, lalu memantul pelan sampai diam.": "Faces go only on objects, not people. The object's motion is driven by position, squash and stretch, angle, eyes, and mouth. The face never changes abruptly: the object always anticipates first, the new face appears at the deepest point, then it bounces gently to rest.",
"Benda polos + stiker wajah, ditempel dari jangkar wajah per frame.": "Plain object + face sticker, placed from the face anchor each frame.",
"Squash menjaga luas: sx = 1 + (1 − sy) × 0,5, jangkar di dasar.": "Squash keeps the area: sx = 1 + (1 − sy) × 0.5, anchored at the base.",
"Mata memimpin, badan menyusul 2-5 frame; kerumunan berselang 0,07 s.": "Eyes lead, the body follows 2-5 frames later; the crowd staggers by 0.07 s.",
"Bayangan kontak mengecil saat melompat. Kedip = mata dipipihkan jadi garis.": "The contact shadow shrinks on a jump. Blink = eyes flattened into a line.",
