"Pantulan dihitung dari tiga angka: seberapa jauh melewati target, seberapa cepat bergetar, dan seberapa cepat meredam. Gerak cepat butuh 2-4 frame, gerak normal 6-8, gerak santai 12-15. Animasi kertas biasanya digambar 12 kali per detik.": "The bounce comes from three numbers: how far it overshoots the target, how fast it oscillates, and how fast it settles. Fast moves take 2-4 frames, normal moves 6-8, relaxed moves 12-15. Paper animation is usually drawn 12 times per second.",
