"Volume tetap: x = 100 + (100 - y) × 0,5. Saat jatuh cepat bola memanjang searah gerak, saat menyentuh lantai memipih; kedip = mata di-squash jadi garis.": "Volume stays constant: x = 100 + (100 - y) × 0.5. Falling fast, the ball stretches along the motion; touching the floor, it flattens; blink = eyes squashed into a line.",
"Wind-up 0-10 f, transisi 10-12 f, aksi utama 12-30 f, settle 30-40 f. Gerak terbesar terjadi dalam sekitar 3 frame, lalu ease ke puncak.": "Wind-up 0-10 f, transition 10-12 f, main action 12-30 f, settle 30-40 f. The biggest move happens in about 3 frames, then eases into the peak.",
"Ease in/out di setiap pose kunci. Jarak antar-frame rapat di ujung (lambat) dan renggang di tengah (cepat); kurva curam = cepat.": "Ease in/out at every key pose. Frame spacing is tight at the ends (slow) and wide in the middle (fast); steep curve = fast.",
"Ujung tungkai bergerak di busur (rotasi FK), bukan garis lurus. Head turn sedikit turun di tengah; benda di lintasan lompat diputar searah lintasan (atan2).": "Limb tips move in arcs (FK rotation), not straight lines. A head turn dips slightly in the middle; an object on a jump path is rotated along the path (atan2).",
"Gerak sekunder": "Secondary action",
"Layer terpisah, offset waktu, mendukung bukan bersaing. Antena = pegas u'' = -ω²u - 2ζωu' - a_lateral, ω = 2π × 2,3 Hz, ζ = 0,14; frekuensi pegas jauh dari ayunan jalan 1 Hz.": "Separate layer, time offset, supporting not competing. Antenna = spring u'' = -ω²u - 2ζωu' - a_lateral, ω = 2π × 2.3 Hz, ζ = 0.14; the spring frequency is far from the 1 Hz walk swing.",
"Di frame tercepat, ujung yang bergerak di-stretch searah gerak selama 1 frame. Diputar 0,4× supaya frame tunggal terlihat.": "On the fastest frame, the moving tip is stretched along the motion for 1 frame. Played at 0.4× so the single frame is visible.",
"Satu fokus; yang sekunder di-blur dan diredupkan; DOF terkunci di subjek + vignette. Siluet tetap terbaca di setiap pose.": "One focus; secondary elements are blurred and dimmed; DOF locked on the subject + vignette. The silhouette stays readable in every pose.",
"Lambat 0,5×": "Slow 0.5×",
"Panel kiri tanpa prinsip animasi, panel kanan dengan prinsip. Panjang loop sama, jadi bedanya murni pada cara bergerak: ancang-ancang, kempis-mengembang, gerak susulan, dan percepatan yang halus.": "Left panel without animation principles, right panel with them. The loops are the same length, so the difference is purely in how things move: anticipation, squash and stretch, follow-through, and smooth acceleration.",
