"Lapisan taman ditempatkan di ruang 3D sungguhan, lalu kamera berputar dalam satu pengambilan tanpa potongan. Benda jauh dibuat sedikit kabur dan berkabut, benda dekat lebih tajam, sehingga kedalaman terasa alami.": "The garden layers are placed in real 3D space, then the camera orbits in a single take with no cuts. Far objects are slightly blurred and hazy, near objects sharper, so depth feels natural.",
