"Tokoh dirakit dari potongan berbentuk kapsul yang bertemu rapi di sendi. Proporsi tubuh, ukuran mata, dan bentuk mulut mengikuti ukuran tetap, sehingga tokoh tetap konsisten dari depan, samping, maupun belakang.": "The character is assembled from capsule-shaped pieces that meet neatly at the joints. Body proportions, eye size, and mouth shapes follow fixed measurements, so the character stays consistent from the front, side, and back.",
"Satu kit potongan, dirakit ulang per tampak. Turnaround memakai dip antisipasi sebelum putar dan settle kecil tiap ganti tampak.": "One kit of pieces, reassembled per view. The turnaround uses an anticipation dip before turning and a small settle at each view change.",
"Ekspresi lewat alis (sudut, tinggi), kelopak (busur ^ tertawa, setengah tutup) dan mulut; mata tetap titik. Kedip = mata di-squash jadi garis.": "Expression comes from the brows (angle, height), lids (^ arc for laughing, half-closed) and mouth; the eyes stay dots. Blink = eyes squashed into a line.",
"12 viseme, hold tanpa interpolasi minimal 2 frame per bunyi. Mulut terbuka = rongga gelap + gigi + lidah + bibir bawah menempel.": "12 visemes, held without interpolation for at least 2 frames per sound. Open mouth = dark cavity + teeth + tongue + attached lower lip.",
"Lengan utuh = potongan rig yang sama diputar di bahu + siku, tangan gestur dipasang di kait pergelangan. Dadah: lengan bawah ±16°, 4 ayunan dalam 1,9 s.": "Full arm = the same rig pieces rotated at shoulder + elbow, with a gesture hand attached at the wrist hook. Wave: forearm ±16°, 4 swings in 1.9 s.",
"Geometri sama untuk semua lapisan: mode proporsi = abu-abu per bahan tanpa garis dan kontak; gaya flat = warna rata per bahan + bayangan kontak; siluet + garis potong = satu bentuk dengan garis potong di dalamnya.": "Same geometry for every layer: proportion mode = gray per material with no lines or contact; flat style = flat color per material + contact shadow; silhouette + cut lines = one shape with cut lines inside.",
