"Satu adegan utuh tanpa potongan: kapal tanker datang pelan, kapal tunda mendorong dari samping, kapal menempel lembut di fender, lalu tali tambat dipasang satu per satu dan lengan muat tersambung. Semuanya digambar dari kode, jadi sudut kamera, waktu, dan suasana bisa diganti kapan saja.": "One full scene with no cuts: the tanker arrives slowly, a tug pushes from the side, the ship rests gently on the fenders, then the mooring lines are made fast one by one and the loading arm connects. It is all drawn from code, so camera angle, timing, and mood can change at any time.",
